/-
Draft/ChainIso.lean -- the two dispatch chains with EVERY search-type leaf supplied as a closed statement.

`chain_gen3` (squarefree) and `chain_nsq` (non-squarefree) take the Iso leaf as the arithmetic condition `IsoH9b N`.
Here it is the closed statement `IsoInst.IsoClosed N` (so it can come from `isoClosed_of_inst`), and the wrappers
`not_tile_nsq_full` / `not_tile_sqf_full` take all search-type leaves (S1, S3, Iso, S4, S5, γ=2α, E60, E120, F1, R8) as
closed statements and only the purely arithmetic leaves as checks.

Composite-N; not prime-case work.  No sorry, no native_decide.
-/
import Erdos634.Draft.N92
import Erdos634.Draft.N70
